// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  ORDER FLOW STRATEGY (OFS)
//  Auction-market order flow day trading process  |  Pine Script® v6  |  Overlay
//  https://github.com/roan-maverick/tradingview-order-flow-strategy-indicator
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//
//  THE PROCESS
//  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//   1. ENVIRONMENT    Higher-timeframe value structure (value up / value down / balance) + gamma regime
//   2. LOCATION       Value area (VAH / POC / VAL) and a Fibonacci discount or premium zone
//                     (0.705 / 0.788 / 0.886) that sits outside value
//   3. CONFIRMATION   Absorption (aggression with no result at the candle extreme), a first shift,
//                     then the aggressive side fails a SECOND time, higher (or lower): enter
//   4. MANAGEMENT     Stop beyond the failure, value reclaim checkpoint, full target at the last swing,
//                     stop trailing behind the aggression from the POC / gamma wall, breakeven rules,
//                     max trades per day, stop after consecutive losses
//
//  MODULES
//  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//   01 Environment Engine     02 Value Area Profile      03 Discount / Premium Zone
//   04 Order Flow Engine      05 Absorption Detector     06 Second Failure Entry
//   07 Trapped Traders        08 Trade Management        09 Target Map
//   10 Footprint              11 Strategy Dashboard      12 AI Agent Packet
//   13 Order Flow Pressure    14 Resting Liquidity       15 Inefficiencies & Impulse
//
//  INTEGRITY
//  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//   • Setups, entries and trade tracking run on CLOSED bars only: no repainting.
//   • Higher-timeframe structure uses the previous CLOSED higher-timeframe bar (expr[1] + lookahead_on).
//   • Swing points are used only after full confirmation.
//   • Order flow is ESTIMATED from lower-timeframe candles (request.security_lower_tf): volume on up
//     candles counts as aggressive buying, volume on down candles as aggressive selling. That keeps the
//     indicator free on every TradingView plan.
//   • Works on any market with volume data. Built for 1 to 15 minute charts (5 minute recommended).
//
//  For education and research. Not financial advice.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

//@version=6
indicator("Order Flow Strategy", shorttitle = "OFS", overlay = true, max_labels_count = 500, max_boxes_count = 500, max_lines_count = 500)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  INPUTS
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
